{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗揭發屍體發現案。今日（13日）下午4時40分，警方接獲汝州街175至177號富裕大廈保安報案，指懷疑一名男住戶在單位內暈倒。</p><p>救護員接報到場，經檢查後證實56歲姓梁男事主已明顯死亡。警方將安排為他驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗汝州街175至177號富裕大廈一名男住戶倒斃屋內。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186794131234492416362798.jpeg/hui-KlCwRY7bdjOTx88CYGY1cNipgYb-OuxqADrsagA\"/><figcaption>深水埗汝州街175至177號富裕大廈一名男住戶倒斃屋內。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.495768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:43:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:33.136919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:33.136919+00:00","content_hash":"ef5de865b3f500af41d994b59736cfc67ec60c0d86d2d8d674c761b35de7aeda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}